{"data":[{"author_id":"2100982288456826882","created_at":"2026-09-19T17:02:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2101356173333254195"],"id":"2101356173333254195","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":18,"impression_count":30499,"like_count":81,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":34,"retweet_count":0},"text":"关于言语刺激\n我非常看重这一点 直接关乎到性兴奋程度 很遗憾大多数男的嘴巴都笨笨的 所以我想重点讲这个\n不过今天已经写了一整天了 我的脑子好疼 明天再写吧宝宝们 晚安","url":"https://x.com/kittenpoems/status/2101356173333254195"},{"author_id":"2100982288456826882","created_at":"2026-09-19T16:53:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2101354010125214141"],"id":"2101354010125214141","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":29036,"like_count":69,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":20,"retweet_count":0},"text":"卧槽男神一直猫塑我 我被萌得尖叫🙀\n我和他说推特太好玩了 今天一整天都躺在床上抱着手机发帖帖 甚至因为一直打字 手机都把小手指压凹陷了\n他说你快检查一下是不是有猫薄荷\n\n请问一下本宝宝有不爱上的理由吗 好上头吧 好想和他do一下 do几下也行。","url":"https://x.com/kittenpoems/status/2101354010125214141"},{"author_id":"2100982288456826882","created_at":"2026-09-19T16:27:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2101347538196709779"],"id":"2101347538196709779","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":32710,"like_count":41,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":35,"retweet_count":0},"text":"其实我也有很多不会的 我没那么厉害 就比如说 我从来都没找到过g点在哪里 也从来没体会过阴道内高潮和喷水是什么感觉 我要学习的还有很多！路漫漫其修远兮","url":"https://x.com/kittenpoems/status/2101347538196709779"},{"author_id":"2100982288456826882","created_at":"2026-09-19T16:22:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2101346131561300027"],"id":"2101346131561300027","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":55812,"like_count":260,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":63,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我必须睡到这位男神。 https://t.co/O8GFnw40Iw","url":"https://x.com/kittenpoems/status/2101346131561300027"},{"author_id":"2100982288456826882","created_at":"2026-09-19T16:03:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2101341461870764187"],"id":"2101341461870764187","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":29780,"like_count":49,"quote_count":0,"reply_coun